sequenceDiagram
%% process-key: oss-intake-supply-chain-governance
    participant role_software_engineer as Software engineer
    participant role_service_owner as Service owner
    participant role_sbom_curator as SBOM curator
    participant role_license_counsel as License counsel
    participant role_compliance_steward as Compliance steward
    participant role_security_reviewer as Security reviewer
    participant system as Open-source intake and supply-chain governance
    role_software_engineer->>system: Register component intake request
    system-->>role_software_engineer: evidence -> Component intake request
    role_sbom_curator->>system: Verify component identity and maintenance posture
    system-->>role_sbom_curator: evidence -> Component identity registration draft, Upstream identity and maintenance summary
    role_license_counsel->>system: Analyze license obligations and redistribution constraints
    system-->>role_license_counsel: evidence -> License obligation matrix, Component license metadata entry
    role_security_reviewer->>system: Review security posture and provenance trust
    system-->>role_security_reviewer: evidence -> Security review note, Provenance report
    role_software_engineer->>system: Approve, reject, or constrain adoption
    system-->>role_software_engineer: evidence -> SBOM manifest, Component approval note
    Note over system: branches -> Approved, Rejected
    role_sbom_curator->>system: Hand off obligations and establish re-review triggers
    system-->>role_sbom_curator: evidence -> Published obligation handoff, Component re-review trigger log
